  meta='Each pair <b>finds on the keyboard the note you point to on the stave</b> on the board, counting the steps from the first note; the class confirms with a thumbs-up. Also: count lines and spaces from the bottom, and show with the body whether a note is on a line or in a space.',
  necesita='A computer with a speaker, the board (and a projector, if possible) and <b>a sheet with five lines</b> per pupil. It helps to have done Lesson 2.',
