  meta='Each pair <b>reads aloud the names of a short melody in the treble clef</b>, counting from G, <b>and plays it on the keyboard</b>; the class confirms with a thumbs-up. Also: draw the treble clef and point to line 2, and name G’s neighbours, A above and F below.',
