   ('Application: march, waltz or song?', '<b>Guess the time</b>: you play without saying which, the class moves, a pair writes the two numbers and the class gives a thumbs-up. <b>Reading the time signature in the score</b>: the clef, the C, the bar lines and the double bar line; the song has 12 bars.'),
