   ('Application: the carousel and Bartók', '<b>The carousel</b>: on each slide, “chromatic” or “diatonic”, first the whole class, then pairs at the front; on each tone, where the comma is. <b>Bartók</b>: the phonograph, E♯ and F; which is higher? <b>The worksheet</b>: six steps.'),
