  meta='Each group <b>plays on the Keyboard the nine chords of the Seikilos kithara</b>, one per bar, with the melody; the class says whether each chord is major or minor. Also: build a chord “skipping one each time” on any note, and say which degrees give major chords (I, IV, V) and which minor (ii, iii, vi).',
  necesita=f'A computer with a speaker and internet, the {KB}, Seikilos in the Score in both versions ({SEI2}, with the drone, and {SEIA}), the board (and a projector, if possible). It helps to have done Lessons 6, 7 and 8.',
